      "worked": "Subtract each angle from $90^\\circ$ for its complement and from $180^\\circ$ for its supplement.\n$$\\begin{align*}90^\\circ-25^\\circ&=65^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-25^\\circ&=155^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-65^\\circ&=25^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-65^\\circ&=115^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-13^\\circ&=77^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-13^\\circ&=167^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-79^\\circ&=11^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-79^\\circ&=101^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-57^\\circ&=33^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-57^\\circ&=123^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-3^\\circ&=87^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-3^\\circ&=177^\\circ\\\\90^\\circ-41^\\circ&=49^\\circ\\\\180^\\circ-41^\\circ&=139^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
